  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — Major evolution: dump command (structured binary inspection with checksum verification). Rich types: enums for valueMap, [Flags] enum for bitfields. Typed exceptions: InvalidSignatureException, ChecksumMismatchException, TruncatedFileException. Multi-language output: --lang csharp-span (zero-alloc Span<byte>), fsharp (DU + records), rust (TryFrom<&[u8]>). --project flag for complete multi-file C# project output. README updated: 757 binary format count clarified.",
